py-flowtoken is an adaptation of FlowToken by Ephibbs and contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/Ephibbs/flowtoken
Reference package: flowtoken@1.0.40, published with ISC license metadata.

The named animation effects and their keyframe definitions are adapted from
FlowToken. Python rendering, framework adapters, streaming state, and the
browser renderer are implemented in this repository.

The upstream README labels its license MIT; its published package labels it
ISC. Both notices are recorded here rather than presenting this project as
an official upstream release. The ISC terms for this distribution are in
LICENSE. No upstream React runtime is included in the distribution.
